{
  "title": { "zh": "转一转，换盏灯", "en": "Turn it, relight it" },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "检查台旁边多了一个受控的小场景：一个物体、一架能绕着它转的相机和一盏灯。场景渲出的每张图，你都可以拿来和候选图比。",
        "en": "Beside the station there is now a small controlled scene: one object, a camera that orbits it and a lamp. Every picture the scene renders can be compared with the candidates."
      }
    },
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "这一关的问题是：两张图的像素几乎都不同，拍的会是同一个物体吗？参照图拍的是场景里的物体；选出所有拍的也是它的候选图。",
        "en": "This level asks: when two pictures differ in almost every pixel, can they show the same object? The reference shows the object in the scene; choose every candidate that shows it too."
      }
    }
  ],
  "after": {
    "zh": "同一个物体换个视角、换盏灯，像素几乎全变，这叫<wiki-ref to=\"intra-class-variation\"></wiki-ref>。",
    "en": "One object seen from another angle or under another light changes nearly every pixel: this is <wiki-ref to=\"intra-class-variation\"></wiki-ref>."
  },
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "0B1",
      "kind": "choice",
      "step": { "zh": "换视角", "en": "Viewpoint" },
      "brief": {
        "zh": "转动场景的相机，选出拍的是参照图里那个物体的全部候选图。",
        "en": "Turn the scene's camera, and choose every candidate that shows the object of the reference."
      },
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "别逐个比像素：转动相机，看场景能不能渲出和候选图一样的画面。",
          "en": "Do not compare pixels one by one: turn the camera and see whether the scene can render the candidate's picture."
        }
      ],
      "after": {
        "zh": "换了视角的图和参照图几乎没有一个像素相同，物体却没变。接下来动的是灯。",
        "en": "Pictures from another viewpoint share almost no pixel with the reference, yet the object is the same. Now the lamp moves."
      },
      "judge": { "same": { "vary": "camera" } },
